---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Community | Pine Lake Covenant Church">
  <article class="page">
    <header class="page__header">
      <h1>Community</h1>

      <p class="page__lede">
        Pine Lake is more than a Sunday gathering. For those who call this church home, community is where faith is
        practiced through relationships, service, generosity, and shared life.
      </p>
      <figure class="media">
        <div class="media__frame ratio-16x9">
          <span class="media__label">Hero photo placeholder (community)</span>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Life together</h2>

      <p>
        Community at Pine Lake takes many forms — gathering in smaller groups, serving alongside others, and supporting
        one another through different seasons of life.
      </p>

      <div class="media__frame ratio-4x3">
        <span class="media__label">Photo placeholder</span>
      </div>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Life Groups</strong><br />
          Small groups that meet regularly to build relationships, study Scripture, and grow together.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Serve & Volunteer</strong><br />
          Opportunities to serve within the church and in the wider community.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Practicing generosity</h2>

      <p>
        Giving is one way we respond to God’s generosity toward us. It supports the mission and ministries of Pine Lake
        and helps us care for our community, both locally and globally.
      </p>

      <div class="media__frame ratio-4x3">
        <span class="media__label">Photo placeholder</span>
      </div>

      <p>
        <a href="https://plcc.churchcenter.com/giving">Learn more about giving at Pine Lake</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Care & support</h2>

      <p>
        When life is difficult, the church is here to offer prayer, care, and practical support. You don’t have to walk
        alone.
      </p>

      <div class="media__frame ratio-4x3">
        <span class="media__label">Photo placeholder</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Getting started</h2>

      <p>
        If you’re exploring community at Pine Lake for the first time,
        <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}next-steps/`}>Next Steps</a>
        is a great place to begin.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
